~ start
if not GameState.save_data.talked_to_rat
	Nathan: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], this is dialogue for the first time.
else
	Nathan: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], this is dialogue after we have spoken already.
Nathan: Here are some choices.
- First one
	Nathan: You picked the first one.
- Second one
	Nathan: You picked the second one.
- Start again => start
- End the conversation => end_dialogue
Nathan: For more information see the online documentation.
~ end_dialogue
$> debug("Setting talked_to_rat to true")
$> GameState.save_data.talked_to_rat = true
=> END